osted game after recording the first clone.","src","/GameMap/media/learning/eight-second-crew-codex.webp","alt","A duck thief and its recorded clone in the opening museum, with key, guard sight cone and eight-second HUD.","https://sdj3261.github.io/openai_game_2026/","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","GameMap browser capture","list","attribution","Creator-attributed clients / models (not inferred from related tools)","items",[81],"Codex","links","Related resources",[87],"resourceIds","section",{"_58":88,"_25":89},"OpenAI Codex","/resources/codex/","Creator evidence",[93],"evidence",{"_58":94,"_25":95,"_96":97},"Read the author’s human and Codex division of work","https://github.com/sdj3261/openai_game_2026#codex와-함께-만든-과정","note","README and the creator’s linked article describe concrete planning, implementation, sprite, QA and deployment work; neither is a complete session transcript.","Source contents","complete project","Project source",[102],{"_58":103,"_25":104,"_96":105},"Open the complete game project","https://github.com/sdj3261/openai_game_2026","Complete static project with modules, nine stages, sprites, fonts, tests and demo recording. Node.js 18+; npm start, with no dependency installation. Code has no explicit license; the bundled Galmuri font uses OFL.","Access type","playable","demo","Play or run",[111],{"_58":112,"_25":69,"_96":113},"Play 8-Second Crew","Korean, English and Japanese; keyboard, click-to-move and touch. WASD/arrows move, X records a clone, Z lures guards, and R restarts. Wait through the brief Ready countdown before moving.","Game platform","Browser","Guide format","build log","tutorial","Build story / tutorial",[121],{"_58":122,"_25":95,"_96":-7},"Read the creator’s Codex build account","Study this workflow","ordered",true,[127,128,129,130],"Start the first stage and learn movement, keys and exits.","Read the creator’s Codex development account and asset credits.","Press X to record a route, then inspect how the clone replays it.","C